OL,5,Aissued along US Gulf Coast
OL,6,
OL,7,F"Get out NOW!" warn some Florida
OL,8,Fofficials as they urge residents to
OL,9,Ffollow evacuation orders - see where
OL,10,Felse people are being asked to leave
OL,12,FStates of emergency have also been
OL,13,Fissued in parts of Alabama, Florida and
OL,14,Fin all of Georgia as they brace for
OL,15,Fheavy rain
OL,17,FTravelling? Find out which airports
OL,18,Fhave closed and where train routes have
OL,19,Fbeen disrupted
